# The premise store is append-only JSONL written by every run and committed back by the
# scheduled workflow, which does `git pull --rebase --autostash` first. Two runs that interleave
# both append at the end of the file, which is a textbook rebase conflict on the last line.
# A union merge keeps both lines, which is exactly the desired semantics for an append-only log.
assets/premise_store.jsonl merge=union
